  "description": "**Emails only please** Buckley Real Estate are proud to bring this stunning one-bedroom apartment to the rental market. Finished to an incredibly high standard in the sought after Capel Street, the apartment comes fitted with the kitchen area fitted with all electrical goods, including cooker and hob and a dual washer dryer. There is a spacious bedroom with a double bed and a large wardrobe. The bathroom is finished with a walk-in electric shower on top of a bath tub. There is parking available, however, you will need to get in touch with Dublin City Council to rent a space in one of the side streets nearby. This ideal location is within easy walking distance of the city centre. The property is well served by public transport with numerous bus routes and the LUAS nearby and there is an excellent range of bars, restaurants and retail stores close by. The local University TU Dublin Grangegorman is a short walk from the property and The Mater Hospital is a short drive away.\n\n",
